{"posts":[{"id":"art_p11_251","t":"USDSGD TG2 was pure nonsense. it is clearly tanking up. so TG should have been that FL that is on top of marked DBD.\n\nSo idea was good. Execution - fine. SL - fine. TG1 - fine. TG2 - not rational at all.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#251","p":11,"im":["dc5729798611fc5f7e46413c731faf34b7d7fbd8"],"m":251},{"id":"art_p11_252","t":"#2 chart from Time Series of mine.\n\nGreen rectangle area that seems like supply. Yellow rectangle - H1 RBD. Blue line -DP/source of the drop. Have marked it last week but could not find a way into it. From what I see it is not ready for a big drop yet.. nothing of importance was engulfed.\n\nPost reaction probably there was a way to make some pips. Real time kind of hard to be objective when price is ticking.... I suppose, I'm getting stressed out.\n\nReaction is still amazing to the source.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#252","p":11,"im":["b89c6813f250f0b2db192a3f88ee0acdee12ed78","fd6f20f77b8f7fc9d9de360a6ffbfbe5cad10ddd","2ac59a3d56c65f335c5dd4d02b18320a5bc77687"],"m":252},{"id":"art_p11_253","t":"","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#253","p":11,"im":["ec6975beb4d98dfc843e695875179f52fc9e199c","26c1ea6a8b2b94b36759ce9cf8bc92ae8c4df2a1"],"m":253},{"id":"art_p11_254","t":"Long EJ. Risk is still on! waiting to reduce it a little bit!","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#254","p":11,"im":["076686dab28823e33d2169349b8dfa1967eb90f3"],"m":254},{"id":"art_p11_255","t":"blessed by god as the holy ghost talks to me.","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#255","p":11,"im":["5e20eeaaa667d217ac58a0d8293b7d8b4d1449a4","ca9b5c7da43b91ca6b7e35511c9e2e8e532deb72"],"m":255},{"id":"art_p11_256","t":"seems like QM on EURUSD.\n\nAswilled.. they way you express yourself... not sure are you on drugs or not! Nonetheless, great location for Longs on EURUSD.\n\nArt","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#256","p":11,"im":[],"m":256},{"id":"art_p11_257","t":"EJ was a loss!","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#257","p":11,"im":[],"m":257},{"id":"art_p11_258","t":"Art wrote: seems like QM on EURUSD.\n\nAswilled.. they way you express yourself... not sure are you on drugs or not! Nonetheless, great location for Longs on EURUSD.\n\nArt\n\nhigh off cocoa and coffee. call it cocomo.","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#258","p":11,"im":[],"m":258},{"id":"art_p11_259","t":"Guys, why you decided that e\\u wants to go higher?","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#259","p":11,"im":[],"m":259},{"id":"art_p11_260","t":"Wasn't me! I was trying to flirt with EJ but she was not interested to play along","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#260","p":11,"im":[],"m":260},{"id":"art_p11_261","t":"Kovalenko wrote: Guys, why you decided that e\\u wants to go higher?\n\nEU is in a down trend. Look at the weekly on down.","a":"Aswilled","d":"","n":"#261","p":11,"im":[],"m":261},{"id":"art_p11_262","t":"200th anniversary post by me in RTM is a mirror image of attention deficit. not filled. It has set up really well and I think won't come back.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#262","p":11,"im":["1180b05704ed8d28ba5a85b7bede49ebc68ee6c7"],"m":262},{"id":"art_p11_263","t":"Hi there Art,\n\nI was wondering about your spread indicator on the bottom right of your screen. Can you please share the indicator? Thanks in advance Art\n\nCheers,","a":"lv5758","d":"","n":"#263","p":11,"im":[],"m":263},{"id":"art_p11_264","t":"Hi V,\n\nSure. here you go.\n\nFunctions:\n\n- Show Spread: On/Off - ShowRectanglePrices: On/Off (shows top and bottom prices) - BoxTextColour - Spread Font Size - Spread Colour - EDIT: also by default it extends boxes hence the indi name.","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#264","p":11,"im":[],"m":264},{"id":"art_p11_265","t":"One of those from Time Series #3. When to take a trade? if it sets up - take it even during red news","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#265","p":11,"im":["077cb9f338f73a1447cf87a2a767fe17b528c914"],"m":265},{"id":"art_p11_266","t":"+4,5R on USDJPY","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#266","p":11,"im":["ff4ee5850a86bbc4183a0326afc74ff3a76d135d","c41b7275d2d2fca3b12e4b80d4e602023322af9f"],"m":266},{"id":"art_p11_267","t":"","a